("v33", "key", "prompt")
("v34", "type", "String")
("v34", "scalar", "Edit this existing workshop illustration into a genuinely LIGHT, hopeful daylight illustration for a warm parchment-themed website. Preserve the workshop, open door, path into the field, both ordinary adults sharing the repair, offered empty chairs, basin, folded linen, notebook, believable anatomy and overall panoramic composition. Transform dusk into a clear late-morning day: abundant soft natural sunlight through the open doorway and rafters, bright creamy plaster/stone at left, pale sky, fresh sage and olive greenery, warm honey-coloured wood and sunlit linen. Lift all deep navy/black shadows into softly shaded cream, sand and muted sage; especially the whole LEFT third should be airy pale warm ivory with unobtrusive texture, suitable for dark-green HTML text over it. Keep the people and workshop detail primarily in the right two-thirds. The lamps can remain as unlit objects. Beautiful high-quality painterly realism with tactile materials, restrained colour, calm hospitality and everyday service. This must feel open, humane and sunlit, with no ominous darkness, night glow or heavy vignette. Preserve its identity as an illustration rather than a documentary photograph. No text, lettering, captions, logos, borders, halos or watermarks.")
("v33", "value", "v34")
