("v43", "key", "prompt")
("v44", "type", "String")
("v44", "scalar", "Create one high-quality PNG editorial illustration for Aaron Alderman's Questions website page about personally living like Jesus through care, accountable engineering and kenotic service. Panoramic landscape composition, approximately 16:9. Rich painterly realism, extraordinary architectural detail and tactile wood, lamplight and dusk atmosphere, an understated contemporary illuminated workshop opening onto a field. Palette: very deep charcoal navy and indigo shadows, warm amber candle and lamp light, muted sage outdoors, restrained dusty rose. In the RIGHT two-thirds, two ordinary adults of equal standing quietly share a practical repair at a wooden worktable, one making room and offering a chair rather than directing the other. Faces small and unidentifiable, believable anatomy. An open doorway, two empty wooden chairs, a simple clay water basin, folded linen, hand tools and an unlettered notebook suggest hospitality, foot-washing, repair and responsibility. The workshop is human and lived-in, neither grand nor wealthy. A winding path into a softly lit field beyond the open door gives depth and possibility. Keep the LEFT third predominantly spacious deep blue shadow and softly suggested wall/landscape, suitable for a readable text overlay supplied later in HTML. The main illuminated action must remain on the right and should crop gracefully on phones. Beautiful depth and light, quiet moral urgency, service without spectacle. This is a conceptual illustration, not documentary evidence. NO text, lettering, numbers, logos, UI, borders, captions or watermarks. No halos, thrones, religious portrait, fantasy weapons, magical particles, heroic poses, or glowing technological screens.")
("v43", "value", "v44")
